{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一反昨日白雪纷飞的圣诞，\\n今日是清澈透亮的万里晴空。", "text_idx": 157, "plain": "一反昨日白雪纷飞的圣诞，今日是清澈透亮的万里晴空。", "plain_idx": 158, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而我们两个，还在把自己关在房间里接吻。", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……骗人鬼。不是说要克制的吗」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4558", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你不也说要克制吗？」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说是说了，\\n　但我就是控制不住自己所以才要你克制啊」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": "「说是说了，　但我就是控制不住自己所以才要你克制啊」", "plain_idx": 165, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4559", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……啊，抱歉。一看见你的脸就又想亲了」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4560", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，亲我嘛？」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4561", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你这样也没打算让我忍啊？」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要怪就怪自己主动，\\n　没有被别人主导来得心动啦」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": "「要怪就怪自己主动，　没有被别人主导来得心动啦」", "plain_idx": 173, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4562", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听了这种话，\\n不是叫我更想让她心动了吗。", "text_idx": 175, "plain": "听了这种话，不是叫我更想让她心动了吗。", "plain_idx": 176, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4563", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我轻轻挑起纱凪的下巴，吻上她的唇。", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "亲密接触的时候她不自觉露出了紧张感。", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过片刻之后又会放松下来。\\n这些都叫我欲罢不能。", "text_idx": 181, "plain": "不过片刻之后又会放松下来。这些都叫我欲罢不能。", "plain_idx": 182, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「心动了？」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯。心脏跳个不停呢」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4564", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪害羞地把脸埋在我胸口。", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾亲亲的时候也会心动吗？」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4565", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我一直都心动不已哦」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就让你多亲一会儿吧」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4566", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这次换纱凪主动亲上来，\\n直接抱住了我的脑袋。", "text_idx": 192, "plain": "这次换纱凪主动亲上来，直接抱住了我的脑袋。", "plain_idx": 193, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「受不了，新吾真是太可爱了……」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4567", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有点理解纱凪照顾的那些动物们的感觉了。", "text_idx": 196, "plain": "有点理解纱凪照顾的那些动物们的感觉了。", "plain_idx": 196, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她本来就是个面对动物保护欲满满的女孩。", "text_idx": 197, "plain": "她本来就是个面对动物保护欲满满的女孩。", "plain_idx": 197, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后所有的保护欲现在都给到我身上了。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊，我这么幸福真的好吗……」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4568", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「幸福得有点吓人呢」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾的眼神都迷离了，真可爱……」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4569", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过我会让你更沉醉其中的哦♪」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4570", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪的亲吻，和最开始一样，毫不做作。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且自己主动的时候，\\n一定会睁着眼。", "text_idx": 207, "plain": "而且自己主动的时候，一定会睁着眼。", "plain_idx": 208, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好乖好乖，新吾是个可爱宝宝哟～」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4571", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我沐浴在她充满母性光辉的视线之下。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是不是想向纱凪妈妈撒娇了呀？」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4572", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉我的大脑都要被她的温柔融化了。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我开始想要变成一个小孩子，享受她的宠爱。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪，不准再用这种哄小孩的语气说话了」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶——为什么啊？」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4573", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「太可爱了我脑袋都要变奇怪了」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀——真是个让人操心的宝宝呢——」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4574", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "已经无所谓了。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我就像小孩一样紧贴着纱凪的身体。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我也差不多得学学做饭了啊」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4575", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「突然怎么了这是？」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也不知道怎么了。就是这样紧紧抱着你，\\n　突然就想到了」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": "「我也不知道怎么了。就是这样紧紧抱着你，　突然就想到了」", "plain_idx": 228, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4576", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这难道就是所谓的母性本能吗？」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4577", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算你问我，我一个男的也不知道啊。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过有一点是很明确的，就是我现在正在被纱凪宠爱着。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我能进来吗？」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0411", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊可以的，不过请稍等一下」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4578", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她说着松开了我。果然在理央面前还是会不好意思的啊。", "text_idx": 238, "plain": "她说着松开了我。果然在理央面前还是会不好意思的啊。", "plain_idx": 238, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「现在可以进来了哦」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4579", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这声许可就像信号一般，房间的门应声打开。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0412", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，慢着……你那料理是，怎么回事……？」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4580", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我尝试着做的」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0413", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "理央把装满料理的大盆放在桌子上。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": "理央把装满料理的大盆放在桌子上。", "plain_idx": 248, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有香肠和煎蛋，还有切碎的包菜。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然都是些简单的菜式，但确实做得不错。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这是你做的吗？」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4581", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，不过不太理想」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0414", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这可不是什么不太理想啊，做的比我还好耶」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4582", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我的话，要是打算做个煎蛋，\\n　到最后一定会变成蛋饼……」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": "「我的话，要是打算做个煎蛋，　到最后一定会变成蛋饼……」", "plain_idx": 258, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4583", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那副场景自然而然地浮现在我脑海里。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这是你自己练习的？」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4584", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是樱乃乃教我的」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0415", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃教你的？」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到这出乎意料的导师名字，纱凪满脸惊讶。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来理央，我不在的时候，\\n　你似乎经常来我家玩啊」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "「说起来理央，我不在的时候，　你似乎经常来我家玩啊」", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，承蒙樱乃乃教我做饭了」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0416", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到、到底是什么时候……完全，没注意到啊……」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4585", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「下次就由我来做早餐了」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0417", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「臭虫就赶紧找个凉快点地方待着怎样？」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0418", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道这是理央独有的温柔表现方式。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "估计是在为早起参加社团活动的纱凪着想吧。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为此才会来我家，\\n要樱乃教她料理的吧。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": "为此才会来我家，要樱乃教她料理的吧。", "plain_idx": 280, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好意我心领了，但你不会勉强自己吧？\\n　该睡觉的时候就好好睡觉哦」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": "「……好意我心领了，但你不会勉强自己吧？　该睡觉的时候就好好睡觉哦」", "plain_idx": 282, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4586", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0419", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来，你们亲了吗？」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0420", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到这一如往常的提问，纱凪偷瞄了我一眼。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼哼～嗯，不告诉你♪」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4587", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……告不告诉我都无所谓啦」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0421", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像是已经预料到了纱凪的回答一般，\\n理央一副不感兴趣的样子走向一边。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": "像是已经预料到了纱凪的回答一般，理央一副不感兴趣的样子走向一边。", "plain_idx": 294, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，尝尝这个」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0422", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，谢谢」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是，\\n　你这不是给姐姐做的料理吗？」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": "「不是，　你这不是给姐姐做的料理吗？」", "plain_idx": 299, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4588", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你去吃土不行吗？」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0423", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "留下这无情的一句话，理央出房间走了。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4589", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，那要不我们两个人一起吃吧」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要不了多久我也能学会做饭的哈。\\n　我才不会输给那种小孩」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": "「要不了多久我也能学会做饭的哈。　我才不会输给那种小孩」", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4590", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "用不了多久，到底是多久，我也就不去过问了。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
